void certain topics, include certain words, or specific formatting).\"}}},\"pricing\":{\"metaTitle\":\"Pricing | Paperguide\",\"metaDescription\":\"Discover affordable pricing plans for Paperguide. Choose the perfect plan for your needs today!\",\"heading\":\"One Solution for Every Research Need\",\"description\":\"From References to Writing, We've Got You Covered\",\"institutionalPlans\":{\"heading\":\"Paperguide Team \u0026 Institutional Plans\",\"description\":\"Streamline your research process and collaborative research efforts with Paperguide, the all-in-one AI research platform designed for teams and institutions.\"},\"trustedBy\":\"Trusted by students and researchers from leading universities and corporations\",\"faqs\":{\"heading\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"items\":{\"faqItem1\":{\"question\":\"Can I cancel my subscription at any time?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, you can cancel your subscription at any time. Upon cancellation, you will retain access to your plan features until the end of your current billing cycle.\"},\"faqItem2\":{\"question\":\"How secure is my data with Paperguide?\",\"answer\":\"Paperguide takes data security seriously. All Paperguide's data is stored in US location in Microsoft Azure servers and uses encryption and secure servers to protect your information. We do not share or sell your data, ensuring that your research and writing remain confidential.\"},\"faqItem3\":{\"question\":\"What is the refund policy?\",\"answer\":\"If you're not satisfied with the product, we offer a 100% money-back guarantee within 30 days of your initial purchase, applicable only to the first month of the subscription.\"},\"faqItem4\":{\"question\":\"What is the fair usage policy?\",\"answer\":\"To maintain system integrity, ensure fair access, and prevent misuse, our Fair Usage Policy includes rate-limiting measures for unlimited plans. The rate limits for AI generations vary depending on your subscription. For further details, please refer to \u003ca href='