pollution?\",\"question17\":\"Are current climate change mitigation strategies sufficient?\",\"question18\":\"Does social media increase political polarization?\",\"question19\":\"What are the advantages and disadvantages of remote work for employees?\",\"question20\":\"Are mental health resources adequately addressing post-pandemic stress?\",\"question21\":\"Does sustainable business practice enhance profitability?\",\"question22\":\"What are the pros and cons of the gig economy for workers?\",\"question23\":\"Are digital marketing strategies replacing traditional advertising effectively?\"},\"literatureReviewSampleQuestions\":{\"question1\":\"How does artificial intelligence impact job markets and workforce dynamics?\",\"question2\":\"What are the economic and social implications of transitioning to renewable energy sources?\",\"question3\":\"How effective are mindfulness-based interventions in managing chronic pain?\",\"question4\":\"What are the long-term effects of social media use on mental health in adolescents?\",\"question5\":\"How can urban planning mitigate the impacts of climate change in coastal cities?\",\"question6\":\"What role do gut microbiomes play in regulating the immune system?\"}},\"settings\":{\"heading\":\"Settings\",\"logout\":\"Logout\",\"navigation\":{\"general\":\"General\",\"subscription\":\"Subscription\",\"integrations\":\"Integrations\",\"other\":\"Other\"},\"general\":{\"myAccount\":\"My Account\",\"profilePicture\":\"Profile Picture\",\"displayName\":\"Display name\",\"emailAddress\":\"Email address\",\"citationStyle\":\"Citation style\",\"aiGenerationLanguage\":\"AI Generation Language\",\"editDisplayName\":\"Edit Display Name\",\"editEmailAddress\":\"Edit Email Address\",\"displayLanguage\":\"Display language\"},\"subscription\":{\"heading\":\"Subscription\",\"subscriptionDetails\":\"Subscription Details\",\"members\":\"Members\",\"addMember\":\"Add Member\",\"howToActivateSeats\":\"How to activate seats?\",\"membersHeading\":\"Members\",\"enterEmailPlaceholder\":\"Enter email address\",\"membersDescription\":\"Manage your team and their access to Paperguide\",\"areYouSure\":\"Are you sure you want to\",\"thisMember\":\"this member?\"},\"integrations\":{\"heading\":\"Integrations\",\"zotero\":{\"heading\":\"Zotero\",\"description\":\"Import papers from your Zotero Collections\",\"connect\":\"Connect Zotero\",\"disconnect\":\"Disconnect Zotero\"}},\"other\":{\"heading\":\"Other\",\"deleteAccount\":\"Delete Account\",\"deleteAccountDescription\":\"If you choose to delete your account, all your research data, settings, and saved content will be permanently removed from our system. This action is irreversible, and once deleted, you will no longer be able to access any data or services associated with your account.\",\"deleteAccountConfirmation\":\"Are you sure you want to delete your account?\",\"actionIsPermanent\":\"This action is permanent, and all your data will be lost. You won't be able to recover any information once your account is deleted.\",\"typeToConfirm\":{\"part1\":\"Type\",\"part2\":\"DELETE\",\"part3\":\"to confirm and proceed.\"},\"placeholder\":\"Type DELETE here...\",\"goBack\":\"Go back\",\"deleteAccountButton\":\"Delete My Account\"},\"usage\":{\"heading\":\"Usage\",\"usageDetails\":\"Usage Details\",\"usageDescription\":\"Monitor your credit usage\",\"totalCredits\":\"Total Credits\",\"usedCredits\":\"Used Credits\",\"remainingCredits\":\"Remaining Credits\"}},\"aiSearch\":{\"answerFromTopRelevantPapers\":\"Answer from top relevant papers\",\"noDataAvailable\":\"No data available\"},\"chatWithPdf\":{\"hideView\":\"Hide view\",\"pdfView\":\"PDF View\"},\"errorMessages\":{\"somethingWentWrong\":\"Something went wrong!\",\"pleaseEnterSomething\":\"Please enter something\",\"pleaseFillAllRequiredFields\":\"Please fill all required fields\",\"targetWordCount\":\"Target Word Count\",\"targetWordCountMustBeAtLeast100\":\"Target word count must be at least 100\",\"targetWordCountMustBeLessThan6000\":\"Target word count must be less than 6000\",\"pleaseSelectReferences\":\"Please select references\",\"failedToCopyLink\":\"Failed to copy link\",\"noDocumentInSelectedCitations\":\"There is no Document in the selected citations!\",\"pleaseSelectOpenAccessPaperOrReferenceManager\":\"Please select Open Access Paper or Reference Manager\",\"pleaseEnterSomeQuestion\":\"Please enter some question!\",\"pleaseProvideAContext\":\"Please provide a context\",\"pleaseLimitYourQuestionTo50WordsOrLess\":\"Please limit your question to 50 words or less\",\"failedToCreateWorkbook\":\"Failed to create workbook! Please try again.\",\"pleaseSelectAQuestion\":\"Please select a question\",\"pleaseEnterValidURL\":\"Please enter a valid URL\",\"pleaseLimitYourQuestionTo100WordsOrLess\":\"Please limit your question to 100 words or less\",\"documentLimitReached\":\"Document Limit Reached\",\"documentLimitReachedSubtitle\":\"You've selected more than 100 documents. Due to system limitations, only the first 100 documents will be processed for the chat. Would you like to continue?\",\"folderNameCannotBeEmpty\":\"Folder name can't be empty\",\"folderCreatedSuccessfully\":\"Folder Created Successfully\",\"tagCreatedSuccessfully\":\"Tag Created Successfully\",\"downloading\":\"Downloading...\",\"deleteFolder\":\"deleting folder...\",\"failedToDownloadPdf\":\"Failed to download PDF\",\"failedToCreateFolder\":\"Failed to create folder\",\"fileSizeShouldBeLessThan2MB\":\"File size should be less than 2MB\",\"failedToUploadImage\":\"Failed to upload image. Please try again.\",\"invalidImageURL\":\"Invalid image URL\",\"folderDeletedSuccessfully\":\"Folder deleted successfully\",\"failedToDeleteFolder\":\"Failed to delete folder\",\"folderRenamedSuccessfully\":\"Folder renamed successfully\",\"referencesIndexingStatus\":{\"fewOfThePDFsAreNotProcessedYet\":\"Few of the PDFs are not processed yet. It might take up to 60 seconds\"},\"login\":{\"pleaseLoginToAddPaperToYourReferences\