-one AI Research Assistant to get research-backed answers, find \u0026 analyse research papers, manage references, and write documents\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"25\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://paperguide.ai/og-image.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"26\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"32x32\"}]],\"error\":null,\"digest\":\"$undefined\"}\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"13:{\"metadata\":\"$b:metadata\",\"error\":null,\"digest\":\"$undefined\"}\n3:E{\"digest\":\"NEXT_HTTP_ERROR_FALLBACK;404\"}\n"])</script></body></html>